  "description": "Netly is a robust C# socket library designed to streamline network communication.\n            It offers comprehensive support for multiple protocols, including HTTP, TCP, SSL/TLS, UDP, Reliable UDP (RUDP),\n            and WebSocket. This versatility makes Netly an excellent choice for developing a wide range of applications,\n            from multiplayer games and chat systems to real-time data exchanges.\n                \n            Repository: https://github.com/alec1o/netly\n            Documentation: https://netly.docs.kezero.com\n            Fork me: https://github.com/alec1o/Netly",
